{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d5_level_act15d5_st07","groupId":"act15d5","stageId":null,"title":"為更好的自己","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d5/level_act15d5_st07.txt","sourceHash":"5e7d11aadec9c40a8fe59d4f904d02bd8c10ec227b74b4dfcb104e252b292c1b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"這次真是太感謝宴小姐，還有豆苗小姐了，願意陪我出來找草藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只有我一個人的話，肯定不會這麼順利......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我也難得接這樣的外勤任務，還挺新鮮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"別叫得這麼生疏啦，叫我宴就好。女孩子結伴一起外出應該高高興興，親親密密的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不已經是朋友了嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是、是這樣嗎？！朋友......可是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我一點也不懂時尚，也不太會聊天......真的可以和宴小姐做朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼呢，有什麼可以不可以的？只要在我通訊錄上，能叫出來一起逛街的，就都是朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"看，我也把末藥加進去了唷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"好厲害！宴小姐......宴認識好多人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，這裡的分組是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那是“午休時間美甲”組，算是我通訊錄裡人數最多的分組了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"這個呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"這是“團購優惠券分享”組。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"那，這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"“不參加活動但願意來付錢”組！哈哈，這裡面的可都是需要好好珍惜的好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果被加在這個分組裡......我可能......會哭......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"（......應該不會吧？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，聽起來很不錯嘛，這個組裡的好朋友也介紹給我認識一下吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！豆苗小姐，你回來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"久等了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"前頭的路稍微有點難走，多費了點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"順便一問，宴你把我和末藥分在哪裡？不是那個好朋友組吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，你就是想進也進不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"你是“下次一定換我請客”，她在“醫療部”裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？等下，你這什麼意思？明明我請客的次數也不少吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，為什麼只有末藥的分組這麼樸素啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......我覺得挺好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"人家替我治病呢，多少也要尊重點吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）況且誰敢隨便得罪醫生啊。我又不傻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀別在意這種小事。你剛剛不是探路去了嗎，怎麼樣，這周圍還有沒有我們這次要找的藥草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"我看這次也已經採集了不少了，要是沒有的話，差不多就能收工了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我正要說這事！分組的帳之後再和你算......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"先從結論上來說——我確實有點收獲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛我讓阿盤它們分頭去找，發現從這裡再往北邊去一點的地方，確實有一片我們還沒去過的綠地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"阿盤就是你養的那些小寵物？還挺有本事嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然！嘿嘿，這麼點小事根本難不倒我的小傢伙們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡往北......從濕度、光照和地形上來說，確實很適合藥草生長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，那我們快點過去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，等等，聽我說完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......配給的區域圖，我找找......有了！你們看這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在的位置在我標了紅點的這裡，那片綠地大概在這個位置，就這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這裡是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哦，原來我們離艦後已經走了這麼遠？前面這塊，上面寫的是......伊什麼......嘖，這字也太小了，伊比利亞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說那邊的移動城市會變色，駛過的土地都寸草不生，不知道是不是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，騙人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是源石能源技術問題帶來的污染，對土地造成一定影響還是有可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"但是寸草不生......是不是有點太誇張了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"這才哪到哪兒啊，這根本不算誇張的。還有人說伊比利亞的城市都會變形呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"城市裡的地塊都能飛起來重組到一起，變成沒手沒腳，會把所有東西都吞掉的巨大怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"會、會變成怪物嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，和我聽到的好像不太一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說起這個了，現在不是該決定要不要繼續往前走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，到了什麼伊比利亞流言蜚語共用時間嗎？嗯......也不是不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我們這裡沒人敢說自己瞭解伊比利亞吧？那不如各自說說自己知道的，沒准能做參考呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這麼說也是啦，反正也不趕時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經說過了，那下一個！末藥你來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我也要說嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"當然~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的......雖然，可能沒有什麼參考價值......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，我聽說，伊比利亞有很多幽靈城市......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）啊——這不是和我說的差不多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）好了好了，你別插嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"據說迷路的人會誤入這樣的幽靈城，裡面又冷又可怕，地上鋪的都是青色的石頭，教堂裡一個人也沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......仔細看的話，會發現城裡的建築雖然空空蕩蕩，卻都鑲著珠寶，而廣場上堆滿雕像，那些雕像全都是黃金打造，沒有一絲雜質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"珠寶！黃金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，這怎麼聽起來那麼像黃金城的故事，我老爹可會唱那首歌了，我小的時候特別嚮往！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真有那樣的城市就好了，滿地珠寶黃金啊......真想親眼見一見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......我覺得還是不要有機會見到比較好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說在幽靈城裡，每到夜晚，就總會有看不見的東西在教堂裡祈禱，還能聽到有人在耳邊歎氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，誤入這些城市的人，身體都會逐漸僵硬，行動越來越慢，變得像是老爺爺老奶奶一樣，連說話也越來越慢，漸漸地無法思考......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦。這可是酷刑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"最後全身都動不了，既不能說話，也沒有思想......整個人變得和街上的黃金雕像一樣，嗚，原來那些雕像原本都是活著的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"......好恐怖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"騙、騙人的吧？怎麼可能會有這樣的事......這不是比我說的還誇張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定是假的啦，故事是挺不錯的，但如果真的沒有人活著出來，傳言又是從哪來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"是呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才說，沒有什麼參考價值的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是以前和哈默妮一起四處探險的時候，聽別人說的......並不是什麼靠得住的情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"探險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，其實......在來羅德島之前，我和朋友經常到各種地方探險，越危險的地方，越是會有珍稀的藥草。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，看不出來，末藥你也挺能幹的嘛。我還以為你是那種不太出門，整天就蹲在屋子裡配藥的類型呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"而且膽子還很小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是不是該輪到我說了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛想了一下，好像還真聽誰說過這一類的傳言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，還要說嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"你對這些東西還真感興趣啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"說說而已嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你們知不知道伊比利亞有個狂歡節？這個節日倒不是什麼流言，而是真實存在的，我在書上看到過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說這是個特別熱鬧的節日，過去還有不少遊客參加，可是現在都好久沒有什麼消息了，就有人說，這節已經被廢止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"但是呢......我聽說啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說什麼？你，你別用這種語氣說話，讓人毛毛的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"確實有一點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘛，不嚇你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"其實也沒什麼，只是據說狂歡節其實沒被廢止，只是參加的不是正常人而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"據說到了那一天，滿大街都是從墳裡爬出來的屍骸，缺胳膊斷腿的在一起狂歡呢。這時候城裡的市民都得待在家裡關好門，千萬不能出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"那要是，出來了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"這我就不知道了，有挺多不同的說法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"有人說出門就會被吃掉，還有人說出去的人就和中了什麼迷魂咒一樣，會排著隊去城東的樹林裡上吊自盡呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"反正不管怎麼想，總歸不會有什麼好下場就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"好，說完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，還要聽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你的表情變僵硬了。該不會是......你怕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼可能！我才不會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"好好，你沒在怕的。那我就繼續說啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"（宴，臉上完全是樂在其中的表情了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，我們是不是......偏題了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"......是哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"不要忘記正事呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"這些流言奇奇怪怪的，我覺得沒什麼參考價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"只是聽著還是挺嚇人的。你是不是想這麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"不過呢，恐怕也就是因為整個地區都封鎖了，所以傳言才越來越離譜吧，這倒是也挺正常的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們還要往北走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"草藥應該已經採集了不少了吧？要不然......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"......要不然，還是算了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？末藥，怎麼啦，怎麼突然發呆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，沒什麼，我沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"只是稍微有點在意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"末藥","speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","isRemote":false,"text":"會有這麼多嚇人的傳言，伊比利亞......到底是個什麼樣的地方呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別跑，臭小子！你別跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦小的孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"何塞，你敢不聽我的！站住，我讓你不許跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......哎，你哭什麼哭，這可是你自己摔倒的，我可沒碰你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快起來！別想再耍什麼小聰明......都怪你和學堂的老師說我壞話，害我被教訓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有，我沒有說謊話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看見了！安東尼奧，就是你偷拿了米麗薩嬸嬸放在桌上的零錢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你還敢說！你這告密的小人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......不是！不是小人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，孩子們，不要這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"一時的怒火會讓我們犯錯。別被情緒弄昏了頭腦，來，孩子，起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰多管閒事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——不對，您是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這位，這位老爺，謝謝您......沒關係的，不用扶，我站得起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我身上有泥，別髒了您的手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，很謝謝你替我考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"但是不必這樣。誰說泥土是髒東西？我們吃穿，都從土裡生長來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"攙著我的手，站穩。對，這就對了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這位老爺，您是城裡來的大老爺吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"你認得我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"村裡傳遍了，說今天有個城裡來的大老爺，要給村裡演......什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"演講，對了，是要做演講！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，您就是來做演講的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。你很敏銳，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我被委任，到這裡來與各位講訴我們可貴的崇高律條......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您是教會的教士老爺！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您會給我們講教會的那本律法，還有拉特蘭的那些故事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我會的。但是，孩子，我並不會只講這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的律法教我們，崇高的條律堅不可摧，我們該相信，該遵守，該尊崇。這很對。這是正確的......正確，卻有距離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我是一介凡人，所見未必比他人更高尚，所以，我還會說很多我們身邊的值得稱頌的故事。我是為縮短我們與條律的距離而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，您是想說......什麼？太難了，我搞不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，教士老爺，您往哪邊走，要去村長家嗎，我領著您去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我說什麼不重要，重要的是——你聽到什麼。不用勉強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"是往這邊走？哎，小心，別踩到這裡的花，讓它們好好長吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請、請等一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"教士老爺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想問......剛剛，您是不是都看到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您看到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......剛剛我說的，那件事，您都，都聽見了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"——我不能否認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"從你摔倒開始，恐怕我聽得一清二楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，這位老爺，我、我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老爺！不是這樣的，您別聽我亂說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些都是亂說的，您別聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"你認為自己在說傻話，真的是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧並不是壞人，只是，他只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......沒錯！是、是我說了傻話！看錯了......對，是我看錯了！安東尼奧並沒有偷拿東西，老爺！是我看錯了，您不要抓他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"何塞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"何塞，你......你別這樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道說謊話不對。但我嫉妒安東尼奧，明明我的成績比他好，但卻連飯都吃不飽，很快就要讀不起書了，我嫉妒他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盜竊是會被抓走的，我知道，隔壁的胡戈大哥就是在城裡偷拿了店裡的東西，被抓就再也沒回來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以我卑鄙地向教師告發他，誣陷他！這都是我的錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道錯了，您要抓就抓我吧！嗚，求您不要抓走他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"......“我們不當蒙蔽他人，同時令自己蒙塵”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你胡說什麼！誰要你這樣了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我！教士老爺，既然您都聽到了，是我拿了錢......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別再說了，何塞。別......再為了我說謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你從不是這樣的人！上回老佩多羅將你腿都打斷，你不也沒改口替他做偽證嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。謊言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有堅持的謊言會摧毀人，這是卑鄙的。但是......帶著善意的謊言卻會成就人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續說，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"並沒什麼更多可說的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我偷拿了米麗薩嬸嬸的錢，之後我會還！我已經在鎮上找了一份工，報酬很不錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"偷拿是我不好，我會去道歉。但只要寬限一段時間，我就有錢能還了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是為什麼，為什麼要做這樣的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......學費......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你、你不想繼續讀書嗎？！你學得比其他人都好，我知道就差一點錢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，剛剛的不算！你管我幹嘛，和你沒關係！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是這麼一回事，我愛拿就拿了，都說了會還的，被你看到算我運氣不好！要怎麼懲罰我都認了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"教士老爺，您是要抓我嗎，那就帶我走吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"別著急，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"你認為自己做錯了事，對嗎？那麼，現在你要懺悔嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對、對了！懺悔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要認錯，得到寬恕就不用再受懲罰了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"教士老爺，教士老爺求您原諒他吧，您寬恕安東尼奧吧！他會改好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......律條裡說，不當偷竊，不當欺瞞，我是做錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......可我並不後悔。我只能想到這個辦法了，就算要被罰，我也不後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，不後悔的人也可以懺悔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"這取決於你怎麼想。你自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都有弱點。誰能不犯錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"但凡犯錯，是否懺悔就能得到寬恕？可是有誰能夠寬恕另一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我不明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我做的難道不是錯事？做了錯事卻不懺悔，我真是個壞東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"一時犯下小錯，就成了壞人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"懷有惡意犯下一件過錯，即便已受到相應的懲戒，惡意當真就消退，罪人就不是罪人了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這......不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧偷盜錢財，觸犯戒條。而你，何塞，你剛剛卻為包庇他，而對我說了謊，違背戒律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你認為他是惡人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"謊言也為教條所不恥。你認為自己是惡人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不是......可我，我確實做錯了呀！安東尼奧也做錯了，他要是不懺悔，那要怎麼才能得到寬恕呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們難道能夠容忍作惡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不，何塞。當然不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的典律給我們生活的規範，懲罰錯惡，指點向善。在法典之下，沒有惡行應當被容忍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"律條給出的是懲戒。它有力量，會罰真正犯下過錯的罪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"指人向善卻不是一味懲罰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我爹說是大棍和掃帚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"書上說......是悔過。先悔過，承認錯，再改過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說的都沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"你們知道錯誤，懂得友愛，互相著想，這很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"但......“凡要指出錯處，先例出正確的給他看”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧，你要先問自己這個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"問自己。所有的事情，是在哪裡有了差錯，才讓我們不得不犯下罪行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧，你為何偷竊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為......因為我力氣比成年人小，很少有人願意雇我幹活。我沒法湊夠錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是的！安東尼奧都是為了幫我......都怪我自己沒本事，嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都說了不是了！你、你不許哭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我懂了，教士老爺。要是我再有點本事，能再早點找到活幹，拿到錢，我就不會幹那樣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也是......要是我再強壯點，我也能幹活，就不會連累別人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我很高興你們其實都已經發現問題的關鍵所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的軀體往往貧弱，致使我們即便有好的初衷，也要透過不當的手段才能達成。我們的許多同胞因此而犯錯，我感到很惋惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"不過——當然，我們能夠戰勝這樣的困境。我們的律條承自拉特蘭，經過那些光輝先哲們的播撒，在我們腳踏的這片土壤上煥發綿長的光彩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"它會幫助我們度過百年前災變後暗無天日的時光，也會幫助我們戰勝我們自身的貧弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望，我們的信徒不要認為律條是一種束縛，更多地看到其中最純粹的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......太深奧了，老爺，我們要怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"保持信仰。這你們已經做得很好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我們團結，我們向善，我們做一切好的事，這是因律條滌淨了我們的心靈，使我們看清我們心中本就有的善，看清它本來的面貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"這才是我想要告訴你們的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"去相信。相信心靈有力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"虔心，友善，愛人。“為有需要的人提供幫助，對他們好，就像對我們的手足那樣”，安東尼奧，你為何塞而犯錯，何塞你呢，也因袒護夥伴吐露謊言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"盜竊與謊言都是錯誤的。但你們承認錯誤，這小小的叛逆也就很快能夠被改過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會因此過於苛責你們。反而要說，我們正要像對兄弟一樣對待彼此，由友愛驅使去行動。或許我們個體微小，友愛與團結卻會使我們壯大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我們相信法典的教誨，發掘其中對善的鼓勵與呼喚，我們的心意將更貼近，就像最要好的兄弟姐妹那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，我們將最終喚醒我們的心靈。喚醒其中的善與力量......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"它將使我們無堅不摧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我聽不太懂，老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也不太明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"何塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"教士老爺，這聽起來很難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕苦，也別怕難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，就算一時不理解，在你心中的東西也不會折損。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村婦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"主教閣下！您怎麼走到這裡來了，演講台已經搭好了，大夥兒都在等著聽您講道呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村婦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這、這是怎麼了？這兩個小子沒做什麼冒犯您的事吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊比利亞主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"他們很好，都是很好的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊比利亞主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，不能讓大家等太久，安東尼奧，勞煩你帶路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊比利亞主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"還有何塞......來，我們一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊比利亞主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"我們站到廣場上去，讓他人與我們一起認識自己的過錯。然後令自己更強大，令自己更善，更美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊比利亞主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"將來不論要做什麼事，首先分清自己的心意，質問你的心，這想法、這衝動，是否的確發自真心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊比利亞主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"令伊比利亞更好，令我們更好的力量就來自心靈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊比利亞主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，孩子們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊比利亞主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_063","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要相信你自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_117_myrrh","aliases":["末藥"]},{"speakerId":"char_337_utage","aliases":["宴"]},{"speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","aliases":["？？？","豆苗"]}]}
